From 6070bb7b897f263f42019b768a7bb322228b5ffe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "yang.wang" <yang.wang@deepcomputing.io>
Date: Fri, 16 May 2025 14:02:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 297/540] power: cros-sbs-battery: Fix driver registration
 failure with CONFIG_PM_SLEEP

Signed-off-by: yang.wang <yang.wang@deepcomputing.io>
---
 drivers/power/supply/cros-sbs-battery.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/power/supply/cros-sbs-battery.c b/drivers/power/supply/cros-sbs-battery.c
index 5189abddf99a8..c4dbd60ece8bd 100644
--- a/drivers/power/supply/cros-sbs-battery.c
+++ b/drivers/power/supply/cros-sbs-battery.c
@@ -1138,7 +1138,7 @@ static int cros_sbs_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 	if (rc)
 		return rc;
 
-	chip->power_supply = devm_power_supply_register(chip->dev, cros_sbs_desc,
+	chip->power_supply = devm_power_supply_register_no_ws(chip->dev, cros_sbs_desc,
 						   &psy_cfg);
 	if (IS_ERR(chip->power_supply))
 		return dev_err_probe(dev, PTR_ERR(chip->power_supply),
-- 
2.53.0

